      409.24
    ],
    "text": "01.Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cMayans Motor Cycle Club\u201d situated at 175/2, Waragoda,Kelaniya as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
